{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "ea91675b2aae13a80f84e7208d49e3287bd3772a02b8d4b239a5e22e8a1be373", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# EXM-02 — Recurring Examiner Warnings"}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "b944489ae4badae110bea8fe9ee7663f0e11726c31f336291b98fd5ac63ef7b9", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues the recurring warnings the official 4CH1 examiner reports\nissue, as held in the corpus of record (SRC-ER-4CH1): the failure modes the examiners\nname repeatedly across sessions and papers — uncreditworthy answer forms, misread\ndemands, observation-vs-explanation confusions — each anchored to its report and\npage. Every claim is carried on a bounded, page-located excerpt from the run's\nevidence pack, with paper/session identity preserved. Research artifact; canonical\nplanes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "6953baf0ab4298ff7a1ecb8d2f83fd16fad479e853eaa703294b9abbaaefeb83", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** the warning classes visible in the pack's report excerpts — demand-misread\nwarnings, answer-form warnings, and the discrimination/balance framing that locates\nwhere candidates struggle.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-ER-4CH1 (the 2019-06 and 2022-06 report excerpts of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** what examiners reward (EXM-03) and penalise (EXM-04) as their own\ncatalogues; question-specific mechanics (EXM-05)."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "972197ef9d9d22d72aaf7769cfaf343711ddd6a3308418318563987fcf3267a0", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe held reports warn in consistent classes: answers that merely repeat the question\nstem are ruled not creditworthy; answers that give the right observation for the\nwrong reason fail the linked-explanation contract; and test-based items are warned\nover when candidates use the wrong reagent. The 2022 introductions add the papers'\nown discrimination framing — where demand concentrates and which questions separated\ngrades — which tells revision designers where the warned-for skills actually sit."}
