{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "fd9c07936cc3950fddb8f46ccce6ff1901241f2b8e694019b6a277cefc340a59", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-ER-4CH1 — the 2019-06 and 2022-06 examiner-report PDFs of the\npack (page-located excerpts from the commentary zone; per-file identity carried by\nthe paper-dir paths). Paper identity rides on SRC-QPMS-4CH1 per the source\nmanifest's limitation note. No mark schemes were consumed for this artifact (the\nexaminer-sentiment substitution is forbidden); warnings are quoted from the reports'\nown words only."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "9f38362a69a0fbf74d7c12bcc595f6187cda204c95b625da365c8eabc7ce84bd", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe warning catalogue covers the pack's excerpted reports (2019-06, 2022-06);\nsessions held elsewhere in the corpus but outside this pack are not claimed here.\nSessions without public ERs remain source gaps of record. No canonical planes were\nwritten."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:sec:RESEARCH_STATUS", "content_sha256": "8aad38ee4b372ccb57a21fad95e355eda2592d03b381174895f58586e388585c", "heading": "Research Status", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Research Status\n\nGENERATED under SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005 (BL-008 pass 5) from the run's evidence\npack alone; validator of record tools/sib @ 357ace0a; claim QA r3 bound all citations\nto pack excerpts. Research artifact — evidence-backed, not canonical educational\ntruth."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:rec:EXM-021", "content_sha256": "de1c5633232ba84d8e95937134515905a375106e7c787db4335bc4c730b73e15", "heading": "EXM-021", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-021", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-021", "text": "### EXM-021 — Uncreditworthy answer forms: repeating the stem\n\n**Claim:** examiners warn that restating the question's own wording earns nothing.\n**Evidence:** \"Those who did not score here often just stated that the elements were\nin the same group, which was just a repeat of the stem of the question and is,\ntherefore, not creditworthy.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:rec:EXM-022", "content_sha256": "cdf68484af99f38d7dac86683b21157f24704c53c38acca238f0f52e10bece7f", "heading": "EXM-022", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-022", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-022", "text": "### EXM-022 — Demand-misread warnings on description items\n\n**Claim:** examiners warn when candidates answer a different demand than the one\nprinted (naming dyes instead of describing spot counts).\n**Evidence:** \"repeated the question and said that V and W only contained one dye,\ninstead of referring to one spot or equivalent term\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:rec:EXM-023", "content_sha256": "25140e3319f881eb517f438d52a722623dea36ccf0b386bdb522ed7cf8018795", "heading": "EXM-023", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-023", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-023", "text": "### EXM-023 — Wrong-reagent warnings on test items\n\n**Claim:** test items attract warnings for wrong or near-miss reagent choices.\n**Evidence:** \"some lost the mark in (b) for using a lighted or unlit splint to test\nfor oxygen. A very small minority gave an incorrect test, e.g. the test for hydrogen\nor carbon dioxide.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:rec:EXM-024", "content_sha256": "989823aa2e0bef6d40f5ee5afe0b9bfb421aa39ade89860f14455ee15295078f", "heading": "EXM-024", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-024", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-024", "text": "### EXM-024 — Half-explanation warnings on displacement reasoning\n\n**Claim:** examiners warn when the observation is present but the causal link is\nmissing.\n**Evidence:** \"Some knew bromine was formed but failed to explain that this was\nbecause chlorine is more reactive than bromine.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2CR/er.pdf p4).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:rec:EXM-025", "content_sha256": "6fb3cfa3401463f1f38f0f8d60ba02b5f6665f992147e3c6d716a5b3de6b020b", "heading": "EXM-025", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-025", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-025", "text": "### EXM-025 — The discrimination framing that locates demand\n\n**Claim:** the 2022 introductions state where papers discriminated and which\nquestions carried the demand.\n**Evidence:** the 2C introduction frames the paper's spread: \"This paper discriminated\nwell and gave a range of marks for all grades\" with \"The first question was the\nhighest scoring question\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2022-06/4CH1-2C/er.pdf p3); the 1C\nintroduction states \"Candidates found questions difficult\" where application demand\nconcentrates (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2022-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "chunk_id": "EXM-02:rec:EXM-026", "content_sha256": "601e13f05f4176be18cbf02dc9e3a63e7c79ef9057e5ed312a1dc4b6a714a63f", "heading": "EXM-026", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "EXM-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-ER-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "EXM-026", "research_family": "examiner_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": true, "mark_schemes": false, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "EXM-026", "text": "### EXM-026 — Preparation-dependent performance warnings\n\n**Claim:** examiners warn that specific preparation (the Advance Notice) separated\ncohorts.\n**Evidence:** \"Candidates had clearly read the Advance Notice and were well prepared\nfor most questions.\" (SRC-ER-4CH1, 2022-06/4CH1-1C/er.pdf p3); the 1CR\nintroduction's demand-range statement — \"ranging from some designed to be accessible\nfor all candidates, to others meant to be challenging for even the most able\"\n(SRC-ER-4CH1, 2022-06/4CH1-1CR/er.pdf p3).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
